/ Warm Editorial design language — <head> include.
/ Preloads the two most-used self-hosted fonts (roman faces; italic loads on
/ demand) and links the split stylesheet in @layer order. tokens.css declares
/ `@layer pico, tokens, base, layout, typography, components, composed, showcase;` so the
/ cascade is fixed by that list, not by which <link> loads first.
/ Pass `showcase: true` (only /example + Lookbook) to also load showcase.css.
/ The set of files here is guarded by spec/views/design_head_spec.rb.
- app_sheets = %w[tokens base layout typography link button badge tag card field callout avatar figure icon empty-state navbar toast scroll-top menu modal tabs record-header memory-card chronicle-card lightbox insight-manager]
- sheets = local_assigns[:showcase] ? app_sheets + %w[showcase] : app_sheets
= preload_link_tag asset_path("Fraunces-Variable.woff2"), as: "font", type: "font/woff2", crossorigin: "anonymous"
= preload_link_tag asset_path("Inter-Variable.woff2"), as: "font", type: "font/woff2", crossorigin: "anonymous"
- sheets.each do |sheet|
  = stylesheet_link_tag "design/#{sheet}", "data-turbo-track": "reload"
